    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="31">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Abt">Abt</ref> 31</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Gif friman wið fries mannes wif geligeþ, his wergilde abicge, 7 oðer wif his agenum scætte begete 7 ðæm oðrum æt þam gebrenge.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If a freeman lies with a free man’s wife, let him buy [him/her] off [with] his/her wergild and obtain another wife [for the husband] [with] his own money and bring her to the other man at home.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Gif friman wið fries mannes wif geligeþ, his wergelde abicge 7 oðer wif his agenum scætte begete 7 ðæm oðrum æt þam gebrenge.</ab>
      </div>
